@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Initially, it is important to check the Referee Reports.;
:At the same time, you should continue to monitor if the Referee Reports have been completed.;
:Check if Referee Reports have been completed;
:v1: Check if Referee Reports have been completed ({No, Yes}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:If they have been completed,;
:Proceed with organizing interviews;
else ([v1 = 'No'])
:if they have not been completed,;
:you should flag it and send a reminder.;
:After that, you should check again if the Referee Reports have been completed.;
:v4: Check again if Referee Reports have been completed ({No, Yes}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v4 = 'Yes'])
:If they have,;
else ([v4 = 'No'])
:If not,;
:you should flag it again and send another reminder.;
endif
endif
:Organize interviews for Selection Panel;
:Receive feedback from interview candidates;
:Check if Psychometric Test is required;
:v2: Check if Psychometric Test is required ({No, Yes}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'No'])
:Coordinate second round of selection;
else ([v2 = 'Yes'])
:Check if HR Specialist is required;
:v3: Check if HR Specialist is required ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v3 = 'Yes'])
:Schedule Psychometric Test with third party;
else ([v3 = 'No'])
:Proceed to complete Psychometric Test;
endif
endif
:Request final candidate ranking and continue process;
stop
@enduml